@startuml design-2a-dominio-valores
!include estilo.iuml
hide circle
hide empty members
hide <<ref>> members
hide <<ref>> stereotype
hide <<foco>> stereotype
title GastoCerto — Design (vista 2a): valores, competência e consultas (domain.model)

class Money <<value>> {
  + cents : Long
  + {static} EXCHANGE_RATE_SCALE : Long = 10000
  + plus(other : Money) : Money
  + minus(other : Money) : Money
  + splitInto(n : Int) : List<Money>
  + convert(exchangeRate : Long) : Money
  + isPositive() : Boolean
}
class MonthYear <<value>> {
  + year : Int
  + month : Int
  + next() : MonthYear
  + previous() : MonthYear
  + atDay(day : Int) : LocalDate
}
class AccountingMonth <<foco>> {
  + monthYear : MonthYear
  + status : OPEN | CLOSED {readOnly}
  + close()
  + reopen()
  + ensureOpen()
}
class PeriodSummary <<value>> {
  + income : Money
  + totalExpenses : Money
  + thirdPartyExpenses : Money
  + byPaymentMethod : Map<PaymentMethod, Money>
  + byHolder : Map<Person, Money>
  + surplus() : Money
  + {static} of(entries, holder : Person?) : PeriodSummary
}
class ReceivableBalance <<value>> {
  + thirdParty : Person
  + amount : Money
  + {static} of(thirdParty, expenses, reimbursements) : ReceivableBalance
  + validateReimbursement(amount : Money)
}
class Statement <<value>> {
  + card : CreditCard
  + accountingMonth : MonthYear
  + closingDate : LocalDate
  + dueDate : LocalDate
  + expenses : List<Expense>
  + total() : Money
  + {static} of(card, month, expenses) : Statement
}
class Entry <<ref>>
class Expense <<ref>>
class Reimbursement <<ref>>
class CreditCard <<ref>>

AccountingMonth --> "1" MonthYear
PeriodSummary ..> Entry : soma
ReceivableBalance ..> Expense
ReceivableBalance ..> Reimbursement
Statement --> "1" CreditCard
Statement o-- "0..*" Expense
Entry ..> Money
Entry ..> MonthYear

note right of Money
  Centavos em Long: sem ponto flutuante [RNF04].
  splitInto põe o resto na 1ª parcela [RN02].
  exchangeRate com 4 casas em Long (5,4321 → 54321);
  arredonda ao centavo, half-up [RN05 · D1]
end note
note bottom of AccountingMonth
  CLOSED não aceita lançamentos;
  close() de novo lança AccountingMonthClosed [RN08]
end note
note bottom of PeriodSummary
  surplus() = income − (totalExpenses − thirdPartyExpenses) [RN04]
  filtro por titular [RN10]
end note
note bottom of ReceivableBalance
  reembolso > saldo → ReimbursementExceedsBalance [RN03]
end note
note bottom of Statement
  Não é gravada: montada do cartão + competência
  (mês do vencimento) [RN01 · RF13]
end note
legend left
  Cinza = classe detalhada em outra vista (2b ou 2c)
endlegend
@enduml
